<ContentPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How TrueSVG handles information when you use the website and iOS app."
  path="/privacypolicy/"
  eyebrow="LEGAL"
>
  <p>This policy applies to all information collected or submitted through the TrueSVG website and apps for iOS and other devices and platforms.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We do not collect personal information.</p>
  <p>TrueSVG uses artificial intelligence to vectorize images. Images are processed only for vectorization and are not stored by us.</p>
  <p>We do not share data read or recorded by TrueSVG, or data entered by the user, with third parties except when necessary to process that data, such as sending images to AI services for vectorization.</p>

  <h3>Sharing consumption data with Apple</h3>
  <p>By using our app and making in-app purchases, you consent to our sharing data about your usage and consumption of purchased content with Apple when needed to resolve refund requests. This may include details about how you accessed and interacted with purchased content. The purpose is to help Apple make an informed decision about a refund request. We share this data only as necessary and in accordance with Apple's policies.</p>

  <h2>General disclaimer on app outputs</h2>
  <p>The app uses artificial intelligence to vectorize images. Rate limits may be applied to prevent service abuse and maintain availability for all users.</p>

  <h2>Contacting us</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, email us at support [at] buoywatch.com.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If we change this privacy policy, we will publish the changes on this page.</p>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 3, 2025</p>
</ContentPage>
